// endpoint_set_default_model.proto — SetDefaultModel: a model selector row's
// "Make default". TOPBAR section, SetModel's sibling.
//
// THE DEFAULT IS THE LOGIN'S, NOT THE WORKSPACE'S. The daemon resolves the
// account root the named workspace's session spends as and records the model
// as THAT root's default: every NEW session on that login (personal, work, ...)
// starts under it when nobody names a model, and no running session changes.
// The workspace only says which login is meant.
//
// THE MODEL IS THE ECHO TOKEN. The client sends back one of the selector's own
// options (conversation.v1.ModelOption.model) unchanged; a model the selector
// did not serve is `not_in_catalog`.

